  "title": "Vegan Chocolate Banana Oatmeal",
  "description": "This is a wholesome, vegan breakfast oatmeal made with quick-cooking oats, non-dairy milk, cocoa powder, chocolate chips, and banana. Sweeten with maple syrup to taste.",
